      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, siník ooeek, múk Israeli slaqsaywí baweek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki beeto, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a káh, ‹Gwareesirka wák yaangaariir i deer, slám hhaampe'eeriwós ki ló'wa uren, hhaampe'eeriwós i hayaá yaariir awa kal'aá dimbedimbé koná'. Gwareesirí ina /akút ay tloomár Lebanoni, iri iwít gawaá tsitsinír sahhti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halmír gáwtí dirii' ló'wa alé gay tú/, gari húp baraá yaamaá múk halaanu'uumár tlehhiít, gari qás baraá gixsar'ín ar wák i aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo xa'anoó naa sangw ti'iit guri taataáhh baraá yaamaá múk Israeli wa aleeró, guri hátl dír xáw'uú koom, dír ma'aá yaariír koom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xa'anoodá' iri uráy, tay xa'anoó sabiíbudá' baraá xaaií tsa/a/ám, haleemaawós nguri i ki/iyé'. Dee/áruuwós yaamuudá' giri dalaá/, xa'anoó sabiíbu haleemi gay tawo slaslaáx nee loo/ór yaariire.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala gwareesirka hatlá' yaangaariir i deer, hhaampe'eeriiwós ki uren nee ka hayo yaariir, xa'anooduú sabiíbu dee/áruuwós gway amór gwareesidá' xu'ús, haleemaawós niri amoodá' xuiyé' as ngiwa ma'áy eemis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xa'anoó sabiíbu aange dír kuwa tuú/ a baraá asalmodá' kwi haátl, kuri haátl dír hhapér hhohho' nee ma'aá yaariir, as haleemi ngiwa duuxi nee mamu ngiwa laqwaali, as daqaní tawa xa'anoó ló'wa hhoohhoó' oo sabiíbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám daxta anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ u yaahamiís, Xáy, xa'anoowuú sabiíbu iqo harmá/i? Ahaá xáy, dee/áruuwós kuqo tu/iikáhe, kuqo dee/ár altu/iikáhe nee mamuuwós niri dixiyá', nee haleemaawós kudá' dutlutluu/á' niri /ootsiyá'. Heé /uuruú koóm laqaá slaqwaruuse a sla'aanaaká nguwa dee/áruuwós altu/iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamiírihe kwaa mak tawo haátl, xáy ala, i harmá/i? Fur'ár da/aá daahh bira fukuukú' gu kahás, in káh dír koo/idár kilá' niwa ti'iít.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gimáy, daxta mukwí aa dee/anuut yaahaseek. Bar slaqsaywí oo axweesani ku tsatsahhán, kibeeto, ‹Waawutmoó múk Babuloni nina hardáh baraá Yerusalemu, waawutmo guri hingeés nee geeraharuuser'ine, giri huúw ay yaamaá Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy, heé wák guri waawutmoó wa qaás, oo tlahhoó waawutmo, tina axweesani axaasiyé', guri lo'ór /aymiís. Múk pihh'uumár koóm yaamuudae guna hingeés, gway amór saáw i huúw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as waawuti'iimadá' ngiwa diqay tlaaqi, nee masók inooín tidá' waawutmoó Babuloni i kaahi ngin iiaárií qaminá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala waawutmoodá' /abén aa qaás waawuti'iimár waawutmoó Babuloni gana sií', muu gway ya/aáw ay Misri as alee/isoó faras nee oo slaqwaruusér yaariir nguwa firór ay. Xáy, waawutmoowí ga aleesláya? Xáy, oo adoorí ga tleéhh nee oo al'axweesantí gaa sii', sakwasleemaro i kotsóti?›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a tsáp wa káh, adoodá' nirqo dawa, waawutmoowí i gwaa' baraá yaamaá Babuloni, baraá yaamaá waawutmoodá' inós gwaa qaas baraá waawuti'iima, kudá' lo'oodá' gaa waaqaa' nee al'axweesani ga sii'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí ar ló', waawutmo Farao dinkwa nee slaqwaruuseerós tidá' yaariire /iisaro gu aleeslayká dír waawtmoó Babuloniro, qoomár waawutmoó Babuloni koo/ir'ín birnga harweér as múk yaariír nguwa tsu/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma lo'oodá' gana waaqaá', nee al'axweesantadá' gana sií', tidá' inósuú kilá' aa oó'. Nee muruú adór kwí sleémeero guri tleéhh, ar ló' waawutmoowí i baloó kotsqotiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, adór nirqo dawa, asma lo'ór aa /aáy ar umuueé' gana waaqaá', nee al'axweesante'eé' gana sií', ar ló' sakwasleemár hhamhhám ga sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng tsaaxweeli a qaás ar gu oh, inós tsaaxweelir'eé' guri ót, u huúw ay Babuloni, nguri sakwasleemuút as adoodá' aníng iwa geewaqaát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqwaruuseerós tidá' pihh'uumár koom ka tsuu/ ar paánga, nee kudá' naa meetiye' niri diyaa/atiyá' bihhe sleémeero. Daqaní kuungá' a tsahhá' adór anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakoó MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Anuú kilá' dír niina gawaá tsitsinír sahhtiro a taataáhh, eeít halmír dutlutluu/ gawaá haleemaawós kudá' gawto, ngiri haátl gawaá tloomár tleer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeít, aníng a haátl gawaá ságw tloomár tleer ar múk Israeli, as /ayo nee mamu ngiwa laqwal. Inós tay xa'anoó hhoohhoó' oo sahhti, tsir/ór kal'aá yaariir iri mahheetús baraá gamnaangós wa alé, slám mari ngiri tleehhiyá' gawaá haleemaawós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní xaai baraá yaamu sleémeerowo ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ xaa'aá tlet ngir gáwtá wa daraáhh, xaa'aá ququmat ngiri tledemiís. Aníng xaa'aá naa/á' in kahaás, nee awa kaaharen in naa/amií ki/ís ngay ureemiís. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó' nee an tleéhh.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.24"
            ]
          }
